        <span class="num">After night 14</span>
        <h2>Keeping it going</h2>
        <p>Sleep isn’t about perfection — it’s about consistency, intention and loving boundaries. There will be wobbles: a cold, a new tooth, a holiday. When they come, steady the foundations with the free <a href="/free-checklist">Gentle Sleep Reset</a>, then pick your starting point back up. It returns faster every time.</p>
        <p>If sleep is calm but one night-time habit lingers — a single feed, say — <a href="/reset-preview">From Reset to Rest</a> is my protocol for reducing one support gradually.</p>
        <p>You are doing something truly wonderful for your child — and for yourselves. You’ve got this.</p>
